36177,"Carrier battle group never planned to call at Spanish port – Russian Defense Ministry   21:07 Get short URL Russian aircraft carrier Admiral Kuznetsov. © NTB Scanpix / Reuters Moscow has dismissed media reports about how the Russian aircraft carrier group planned a refueling stop at the Spanish autonomous port of Ceuta, with the Defense Ministry saying that such a port call was never scheduled. 
